SERVICES USED AT RUN TIME (not part of this repository)

Map tiles from OpenStreetMap, OpenTopoMap and Esri; the skyways and thermals
overlays from thermal.kk7.ch; task sharing through tools.xcontest.org; and a
Supabase project for accounts and shared tasks. Each has its own terms.

If you run your own copy, use your own Supabase project, and change the `src=`
parameter on the thermal.kk7.ch tile addresses (components/MapComponent.tsx) to
identify your own site.
